<title>MEXICO: Bimbo to propose 0.3 pesos/shr dividend.</title>
<headline>Bimbo to propose 0.3 pesos/shr dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican bakery giant Grupo Industrial Bimbo SA de CV said it would propose to its shareholders a 0.3 pesos per share dividend at its annual assembly on April 29.</p>
<p>In information made available on Wednesday via a statement from the Mexican Stock Exchange, the company said the dividend would be paid from May 8.</p>
<p>(-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9560)</p>
